        <tr><td><strong>License Type</strong></td><td>Both adult-use and medical (mixed market per Weedmaps)</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Dispensary Count</strong></td><td>5 dispensary locations per Weedmaps (mid-2026)</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Notable Operators</strong></td><td>Richardson Remedies (with second location in Presque Isle) and others</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Service Area</strong></td><td>Caribou, Presque Isle, Fort Fairfield, Limestone, Washburn, Van Buren, Madawaska, Fort Kent, St. John Valley</td></tr>
